<View version="0.1" title="Release notes">
  <Col class="gap-3 p-4">
    <Row class="gap-2">
      <Heading>Release 2.4</Heading>
      <Badge tone="success">Stable</Badge>
    </Row>
    <Accordion multiple>
      <Section title="New" open>
        <Markdown>
          - **Shared views**: everyone looking at a view sees the same state.
          - Charts now support *area* and *pie* types.
          - Faster first paint while a view is still streaming.
        </Markdown>
      </Section>
      <Section title="Fixed">
        <Markdown>
          1. Sliders no longer jump when the maximum changes.
          2. Tables keep their scroll position after an edit.
        </Markdown>
      </Section>
    </Accordion>
  </Col>
</View>
